I also join the gender lookup through the superhero's gender id: `FROM superhero AS T1 INNER JOIN colour AS T2 ON T1.hair_colour_id = T2.id INNER JOIN race AS T3 ON T1.race_id = T3.id INNER JOIN gender AS T4 ON T1.gender_id = T4.id`.

